Upstream-PR:     WIP: pending the IIAB maps-role update that pins the r2 go-pmtiles build
Upstream-Status: open
Applies-to:      roles/maps/defaults/main.yml
Summary:         Pin the pmtiles binary to the 1.31.2-r2 build (armhf, arm64, amd64). r2 adds the skip-already-complete-layer check, so a resume no longer re-downloads a layer that already finished (K2GO-317). Interim carry for our bake, ahead of the upstream maps-role update; drop it when that update lands (as 0003 was dropped for iiab#4565). The device-side companion is dash-node 1.5.0 (pause grace, stall and idle watchdogs).

